                    <pd>The mirror mode of the local video. See <xref keyref="VIDEO_MIRROR_MODE_TYPE"/>.</pd>
                </plentry>
                <plentry props="android">
                    <pt>mode</pt>
                    <pd>Local video mirror mode:
                        <ul>
                            <li><codeph>VIDEO_MIRROR_MODE_AUTO</codeph> (0): The SDK decides whether to enable mirror mode. Mirror mode is enabled by default for the front camera and disabled for the rear camera.</li>
                            <li><codeph>VIDEO_MIRROR_MODE_ENABLED</codeph> (1): Enable mirror mode for the local view.</li>
                            <li><codeph>VIDEO_MIRROR_MODE_DISABLED</codeph> (2): Disable mirror mode for the local view.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </pd>
                </plentry>
